\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S5}{\ignorespaces Fidelity and safety are not monotonically associated. (a) Electronic-space distance to the nearest authentic agent against measured AEGL-3 for the 207 candidates carrying both axes; crosses are compounds excluded by the structural filter. The upper dashed line is the measured AEGL-3 of dichloromethane, the incumbent simulant; the dotted line is one order of magnitude below it, and the eight circled compounds are those that clear the lower bar while also falling in the most faithful quartile, numbered by fidelity and named at the top left. The shaded quadrant, faithful and safe at the incumbent's own bar, is empty. (b) The filter applied to the twenty-eight-compound set: nine of eleven authentic agents are Tier~A and phosgene Tier~B, there are no false alerts among the interferents, and DMMP is Tier~C.}}{39}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:h1}{{S5}{39}{Fidelity and safety are not monotonically associated. (a) Electronic-space distance to the nearest authentic agent against measured AEGL-3 for the 207 candidates carrying both axes; crosses are compounds excluded by the structural filter. The upper dashed line is the measured AEGL-3 of dichloromethane, the incumbent simulant; the dotted line is one order of magnitude below it, and the eight circled compounds are those that clear the lower bar while also falling in the most faithful quartile, numbered by fidelity and named at the top left. The shaded quadrant, faithful and safe at the incumbent's own bar, is empty. (b) The filter applied to the twenty-eight-compound set: nine of eleven authentic agents are Tier~A and phosgene Tier~B, there are no false alerts among the interferents, and DMMP is Tier~C}{figure.5}{}}
